title: Authorizations › New case › Step states
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (the stepper and each step's header)
intro: Every step is in one of five states, worked out from the case itself, so the stepper, the step header and 'What is missing' never disagree. Only a few conditions stop a request from being sent (marked Blocked); everything else warns and the person can go on. The states are Complete, Needs attention, Pending, Not applicable and Blocked.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Look at the stepper, or at the pill in a step's header"

group gMeaning "What the five labels mean"
  process m1 "**Complete**\nEverything this step needs is done"
  process m2 "**Needs attention**\nSomething to fix or answer. The person can still go on"
  process m3 "**Pending**\nNot started, or waiting on an agent or a reply"
  process m4 "**Not applicable**\nThe payer needs no authorization, so nothing is prepared or sent"
  process m5 "**Blocked**\nA condition that stops sending, listed on Review & submit"
endgroup

group gIntake "1 · Intake"
  decision d1 "Which is true first?"
  process i1 "Pending · 'Not started'"
  process i2 "Blocked · 'A matching request exists'\nA possible duplicate nobody has answered"
  process i3 "Needs attention · 'N items to fill in'\nPatient, payer, service, dates, the authorization, the proposed change, the reason for a retro"
  process i4 "Complete · 'Patient, payer, service and dates are in'"
endgroup

group gElig "2 · Eligibility & Benefits"
  decision d2 "Which is true first?"
  process e1 "Pending · 'Needs the payer, member ID and dates'\nor 'Verify has not checked yet'"
  process e2 "Blocked · 'Coverage is not active'\nConfirmed inactive, and no documented exception"
  process e3 "Needs attention · 'N warnings'\nor 'The last check is old. Refresh it'\nor 'The check covers other dates. Refresh it'"
  process e4 "Complete · 'Coverage and benefits checked'\nor 'No authorization required'"
endgroup

group gDocs "3 · Clinical documentation"
  decision d3 "Which is true first?"
  process c1 "Pending · 'Reader is reading the files'\nor 'No documents yet'"
  process c2 "Needs attention · 'N required documents to add'\nor 'N documents have a finding'"
  process c3 "Complete · 'N of M ready'"
endgroup

group gPrep "4 · Authorization preparation"
  decision d4 "Which is true first?"
  process p1 "Needs attention · 'An agent could not finish'\n'An agent has a question'\n'Paused in Settings'\n'A step was skipped'"
  process p2 "Pending · 'Not started'\nor 'The agents are working'"
  process p3 "Complete · 'The draft is ready'"
endgroup

group gRev "5 · Review & submit"
  decision d5 "Which is true first?"
  process r1 "Complete · 'Sent'"
  process r2 "Pending · 'After the agents finish'\nor 'Waiting for a clinician to sign'"
  process r3 "Blocked · 'N items stop sending'\nNo patient, payer, service or dates; coverage inactive with no documented exception; an unanswered duplicate; no clinician sign-off"
  process r4 "Needs attention · 'N to acknowledge'"
endgroup

decision dNa "Does the payer need no authorization for this service?\nAnd no documented exception to go on"
process pNa "Steps 3, 4 and 5 read 'Not applicable'\n'The payer needs no authorization'\nStep 1 and 2 keep their own state"
process pWarn "Everything else only warns\nMissing documents, an empty section of the summary, a check that could not run\nThe person can save, go on and send after acknowledging"
goto gNoAuth "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Eligibility & Benefits › No authorization required"
goto gMis "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Review & submit › What is missing"
goto gStep "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › The stepper and the five steps"

s1 --> m1 & m2 & m3 & m4 & m5
s1 --> d1 & d2 & d3 & d4 & d5
d1 -->|Nothing added yet| i1
d1 -->|Duplicate unanswered| i2
d1 -->|Items open| i3
d1 -->|All in| i4
d2 -->|Not checked| e1
d2 -->|Coverage inactive| e2
d2 -->|Warning or old check| e3
d2 -->|Clear| e4
d3 -->|Reading, or nothing| c1
d3 -->|Required item or finding| c2
d3 -->|All in| c3
d4 -->|Failed, question, paused, skipped| p1
d4 -->|Not finished| p2
d4 -->|All ten done| p3
d5 -->|Sent| r1
d5 -->|Agents not finished, or only the signature left| r2
d5 -->|Blocking item| r3
d5 -->|Items to acknowledge| r4
s1 --> dNa
dNa -->|Yes| pNa --> gNoAuth
dNa -->|No| pWarn
r3 -.-> gMis
r4 -.-> gMis
s1 -.-> gStep
